# Normalise line endings on checkout everywhere.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone gets CRLF, which breaks two things: gofmt reports every
# Go file as unformatted, and the shell hooks in .githooks fail to execute.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary content.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gguf binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
